# Used only by `npm run build:capacitor` (vite build --mode capacitor).
# The Android app bundles the web shell LOCALLY (capacitor.config.ts has no
# `server.url` override) so it never depends on a browser, a CDN, or a
# service worker cache -- but that means the app has no "same origin"
# backend the way a normal browser tab loaded from sustena.vyybandasky.online
# does. api.js's BASE defaults to '' (a relative path, correct for the
# hosted web app) -- this makes every API call absolute instead, pointed at
# the real, currently-deployed engine.
VITE_API_BASE=https://sustena.vyybandasky.online
